---
// Case study section: Checked against WCAG AA
// Markup ported word for word from the original case-study.html.
---
<section class="section_case-study-accessibility" data-pane="case-study">
      <div class="padding-global padding-section-medium"><div class="container-large">
        <div class="case-study_block-content is-wide" data-anim="">
          <span class="text-style-eyebrow text-color-brand">13 · Accessibility</span>
          <h2 class="heading-style-h3">Checked against WCAG AA</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="card_list" data-anim-group="">
          <div class="card_component is-gray"><p class="heading-style-h4">Contrast on every text</p><p class="text-color-secondary">Every text on both pages, on its real background, at all 4 breakpoints, including modals, the cookie card and the fixed CTA. All at 4.5:1 or more, even large text.</p></div>
          <div class="card_component is-gray"><p class="heading-style-h4">A darker red for text</p><p class="text-color-secondary">Brand red on the gray cards reached only 4.25:1. Text now uses a darker red at 6.1:1, and buttons keep the brand red.</p></div>
          <div class="card_component is-gray"><p class="heading-style-h4">Fields you can see</p><p class="text-color-secondary">Input borders went from 1.4:1 to 5.5:1, and text stays at 16px so iPhones don't zoom in on focus.</p></div>
          <div class="card_component is-gray"><p class="heading-style-h4">Errors in words</p><p class="text-color-secondary">Upload errors are written next to the field and read by screen readers, not shown by a red border alone.</p></div>
          <div class="card_component is-gray"><p class="heading-style-h4">Works with a keyboard</p><p class="text-color-secondary">The demo flags, the carousel arrows and the tooltips all respond to Tab and Enter.</p></div>
          <div class="card_component is-gray"><p class="heading-style-h4">Motion you can turn off</p><p class="text-color-secondary">With reduced motion on, entrance, scroll and hover animations stop, and every element shows at rest.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div></div>
    </section>
